  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::GameEventSchedule
  events:
  - day: 1
    id: shop_1
    title: FRIDGE CHECK
    body: 'The large pack says VALUE. It has graded itself.

      Compare price
      per food day, then check your rent budget.'
    choices:
    - label: Batch-cook
      result: Meals sorted. Washing up has filed an appeal.
      cost: 64
      foodDays: 4
      income: 0
      delayDays: 0
      mood: 0
      isWork: 0
      isRecovery: 0
      action: 0
    - label: Small shop
      result: Two days of meals. The rest is a future-you problem.
      cost: 36
      foodDays: 2
      income: 0
      delayDays: 0
      mood: 0
      isWork: 0
      isRecovery: 0
      action: 0
    - label: Keep the cash
      result: No groceries added. Empty shelves do not cancel daily food costs.
      cost: 0
      foodDays: 0
      income: 0
      delayDays: 0
      mood: 0
      isWork: 0
      isRecovery: 0
      action: 0
    tipKey: unit
  - day: 2
    id: market_prep
    title: BEFORE THE MARKET
    body: 'You need lunch. The market also sells things you did not know you needed.

      Choose
      a spending limit for this visit. No withdrawal fee.'
    choices:
    - label: Carry $20 cash
      result: 'Trip limit: $20. This is your money, not a bonus or a fee.'
      cost: 0
      foodDays: 0
      income: 0
      delayDays: 0
      mood: 0
      isWork: 0
      isRecovery: 0
      action: 1
    - label: Carry $40 cash
      result: 'Trip limit: $40. Cash still spends remarkably well.'
      cost: 0
      foodDays: 0
      income: 0
      delayDays: 0
      mood: 0
      isWork: 0
      isRecovery: 0
      action: 2
    - label: Use your debit card
      result: No separate trip limit. You still choose every purchase.
      cost: 0
      foodDays: 0
      income: 0
      delayDays: 0
      mood: 0
      isWork: 0
      isRecovery: 0
      action: 3
    tipKey: cash
  - day: 3
    id: work_3
    title: HELP WANTED
    body: Two jobs need filling. You had planned to do nothing. Apparently that position
      is unpaid.
    choices:
    - label: Take the quick job
      result: Paid today. Your feet would also like compensation.
      cost: 0
      foodDays: 0
      income: 90
      delayDays: 0
      mood: -12
      isWork: 1
      isRecovery: 0
      action: 0
    - label: Take the longer shift
      result: Payment is confirmed. Unfortunately, confirmed is not cash.
      cost: 0
      foodDays: 0
      income: 160
      delayDays: 3
      mood: -24
      isWork: 1
      isRecovery: 0
      action: 0
    - label: Take a free afternoon
      result: You sit down. Nothing asks for your card details.
      cost: 0
      foodDays: 0
      income: 0
      delayDays: 0
      mood: 8
      isWork: 0
      isRecovery: 1
      action: 0
    tipKey: 
  - day: 4
    id: hungry_prep
    title: SHOPPING ON EMPTY
    body: 'You skipped lunch. Every shelf now looks persuasive.

      If you have
      stored food, eat today''s portion before shopping.'
    choices:
    - label: Eat a stored meal first
      result: Today's meal eaten. It will not be charged again tonight.
      cost: 0
      foodDays: 0
      income: 0
      delayDays: 0
      mood: 0
      isWork: 0
      isRecovery: 0
      action: 4
    - label: Go straight to the shop
      result: You head out hungry. Check the basket before paying.
      cost: 0
      foodDays: 0
      income: 0
      delayDays: 0
      mood: 0
      isWork: 0
      isRecovery: 0
      action: 5
    - label: Stay home today
      result: No shopping. Normal meal settlement still applies tonight.
      cost: 0
      foodDays: 0
      income: 0
      delayDays: 0
      mood: 0
      isWork: 0
      isRecovery: 0
      action: 0
    tipKey: hunger
  - day: 6
    id: reminder_setup
    title: FUTURE YOU CALLED
    body: 'Set a $40 emergency-buffer goal for Day 24.

      Would a reminder after
      your next payday help?'
    choices:
    - label: Remind me on Day 16
      result: Reminder added to your calendar. It will not save money for you.
      cost: 0
      foodDays: 0
      income: 0
      delayDays: 0
      mood: 0
      isWork: 0
      isRecovery: 0
      action: 10
    - label: Plan to keep $40 now
