  m_text: '<b>TODAY''S NOTE</b>


    Check your balance and upcoming commitments
    before ending the day.


    Next rent: $500 on 15 Sep.

    Next wages: +$700
    on 18 Sep.


    <b>AT THE END OF TODAY</b>

    Food: $20 without stored groceries.

    Other
    essentials: $10.


    Living costs are paid first, followed by rent if it is
    due. Open your money tracker at any time to review the figures.'
